Aapne jo files provide ki hain, unmein filhaal **Admin Panel ki koi visual UI file nahi hai**. 

Aapke project mein Admin Panel ka **logic** (jaise login check aur database se inquiries nikalna) toh `services/supabase.ts` mein likha hua hai, lekin uska **interface** (jahan aap login karke data dekh sakein) abhi missing hai.

Ek professional structure mein, Admin Panel ki file ka naam usually `components/AdminPanel.tsx` ya `pages/Admin.tsx` hota hai. 

Kyuki aapne kaha hai ki website mein change mat karna, isliye main code update nahi kar raha hoon, lekin aapki jaankari ke liye main niche wo code de raha hoon jo aap ek nayi file `components/AdminPanel.tsx` banakar use kar sakte hain.

### Admin Panel File Name: `components/AdminPanel.tsx`
**Code:**

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { Lock, LogOut, MessageSquare, Trash2, Loader2, X } from 'lucide-react';
import * as db from '../services/supabase';
import { Inquiry } from '../types';
import Button from './Button';

const AdminPanel = () => {
  const [email, setEmail] = useState('');
  const [password, setPassword] = useState('');
  const [isLogged, setIsLogged] = useState(false);
  const [inquiries, setInquiries] = useState<Inquiry[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (db.isAdminLoggedIn()) {
      setIsLogged(true);
      fetchInquiries();
    }
  }, []);

  const fetchInquiries = async () => {
    setLoading(true);
    const data = await db.getInquiries();
    setInquiries(data);
    setLoading(false);
  };

  const handleLogin = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    setLoading(true);
    const res = await db.adminLogin(email, password);
    if (res.success) {
      setIsLogged(true);
      fetchInquiries();
    } else {
      alert("Invalid Credentials");
    }
    setLoading(false);
  };

  const handleDelete = async (id: string) => {
    if (confirm("Delete this inquiry?")) {
      await db.deleteInquiry(id);
      fetchInquiries();
    }
  };

  if (!isLogged) {
    return (
      <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-gray-900 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div className="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 max-w-md w-full shadow-2xl">
          <div className="flex justify-center mb-6">
            <div className="p-4 bg-primary/10 rounded-full text-primary"><Lock size={32} /></div>
          </div>
          <h2 className="text-2xl font-black text-center mb-8">ADMIN LOGIN</h2>
          <form onSubmit={handleLogin} className="space-y-4">
            <input required type="email" placeholder="Email" className="w-full p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border-none outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" value={email} onChange={e => setEmail(e.target.value)} />
            <input required type="password" placeholder="Password" className="w-full p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border-none outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary" value={password} onChange={e => setPassword(e.target.value)} />
            <Button fullWidth disabled={loading}>{loading ? <Loader2 className="animate-spin" /> : 'LOGIN'}</Button>
            <button type="button" onClick={() => window.location.hash = '#home'} className="w-full text-gray-400 font-bold text-sm py-2">Back to Home</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    );
  }

  return (
    <div className="fixed inset-0 z-[100] bg-gray-50 overflow-y-auto">
      <nav className="bg-white border-b sticky top-0 z-10 px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <h1 className="font-black text-xl tracking-tighter">ADMIN DASHBOARD</h1>
        <div className="flex gap-4">
           <button onClick={fetchInquiries} className="p-2 hover:bg-gray-100 rounded-lg"><Loader2 className={loading ? 'animate-spin' : ''} /></button>
           <button onClick={db.logoutAdmin} className="text-red-500 font-bold flex items-center gap-2"><LogOut size={18} /> LOGOUT</button>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <div className="max-w-6xl mx-auto p-6">
        <div className="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
          <MessageSquare className="text-primary" />
          <h2 className="text-2xl font-black italic">Recent Inquiries ({inquiries.length})</h2>
        </div>

        <div className="grid gap-6">
          {inquiries.map(inq => (
            <div key={inq.id} className="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex justify-between items-start">
              <div>
                <div className="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                  <h3 className="font-black text-lg">{inq.name}</h3>
                  <span className="text-[10px] bg-blue-100 text-primary px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">{inq.plan || 'General'}</span>
                </div>
                <p className="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-4">{inq.email} • {inq.phone}</p>
                <div className="bg-gray-50 p-4 rounded-xl text-gray-700 italic border-l-4 border-primary">"{inq.message}"</div>
              </div>
              <button onClick={() => handleDelete(inq.id)} className="text-gray-300 hover:text-red-500 p-2"><Trash2 size={20} /></button>
            </div>
          ))}
          {inquiries.length === 0 && !loading && <div className="text-center py-20 text-gray-400 font-bold">No inquiries found yet.</div>}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
};

export default AdminPanel;
```

**Admin Credentials (जो `services/supabase.ts` में पहले से सेट हैं):**
*   **Email:** `riddhaan@gmail.com`
*   **Password:** `Riddhaan@55`

Agar aap chahte hain ki main ise aapki website mein integrate kar doon (taki aap `#admin` url par jaakar ise dekh sakein), toh please mujhe batayein!

